@MiniOTA.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5238

### Query availability (stay dates 2026-11-20, 21, 22)
GET {{MiniOTA.Api_HostAddress}}/availability?checkInDate=2026-11-20&checkOutDate=2026-11-23&roomCount=2
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{MiniOTA.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
